 tawpa Hollow Park & Campground on Friday\, October 30 at 6:00 PM. Families
  bring lawn chairs or blankets and can get a bite from Riverside Cafe & Gr
 ill before the movie.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.
 com/events/ev-haunted-hollow-een-hocus-pocus-1030.html
